direction: down
title: TLS 1.3 Handshake 1-RTT Timeline

Client: HTTP Client (Browser / App)
Server: Spring Boot HTTPS Server

Client -> Server: 1. ClientHello (Key Share: ECDHE public key) { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
Server -> Client: 2. ServerHello (Server Key Share + Encrypted Cert + Finished) { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
Client -> Client: 3. Computes symmetric keys via HKDF
Server -> Server: 3. Computes identical symmetric keys via HKDF
Client -> Server: 4. Finished + Encrypted HTTP GET /orders { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
Server -> Client: 5. Encrypted HTTP 200 OK Response { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
